For a jump that big consider it a re-implementation, hire some test kit,
do the whole thing properly, lots of planning and plenty of backups.
Do it once on the test kit, document the process then do a DR of the
live kit to the test kit, and do the upgrade on the live kit.
If all goes well, wipe the test kit and send it back to the rental company.
HTH
Adam





